              "value": "Crystal Corruption"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(arcane, curse, incapacitation, transmutation)\n\nCreatures afflicted by this curse slowly turn to solid crystal. This affliction's sickened, slowed, and paralyzed conditions can't be removed until the affliction itself is removed. Creatures with both the earth and elemental traits instead become carriers and suffer no ill effects aside from gaining the weakness to sonic.\n\nDC 30 Fortitude; Stage 1: sickened 1 (1 hour); Stage 2: weakness 5 to sonic and sickened 1 (1 day); Stage 3: weakness 5 to sonic and slowed 1 (1 day); Stage 4: weakness 10 to sonic and paralyzed (1 day); Stage 5: weakness 10 to sonic, and the creature is permanently petrified. ()"
